<title>ROMANIA: Romanian retail sales fell 1.2 pct in Nov.</title>
<headline>Romanian retail sales fell 1.2 pct in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Board (CNS) reported the following economic indicator details:</p>
<p> ROMANIAN RETAIL SALES     NOV 96    OCT 96     NOV 95</p>
<p> volume bln ROL	     2,274.6   2,148.8    1,641.6</p>
<p> pct change mth/mth	    -1.2	+5.4	 +0.3</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr		-0.6	-2.9	+26.2</p>
<p> private sector pct share    77.8	77.1	 71.9</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JAN TO NOV)</p>
<p> volume bln ROL	    20,093.0  17,818.4   14,046.7</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	     +10.6     +12.0	+26.6</p>
<p> private sector pct share    78.7	78.8	 70.5</p>
<p>NOTES -- Year-on-year and month-per-month changes in comparable prices.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
